West Virginia QSO Party in-state county, state and province multipliers
Counties plus 49 other states plus 13 provinces; DC counts as Maryland.
The class adds WV state credit on a county QSO, once per contest (issue 317).
The Wv line below has a display name and NO alias, so it is on the multiplier list
but WV can never be received instead of a county.
DXCC is separate. Only canonical two-letter state and province aliases.

INCLUDE FILE westvirginia_cty.dom
Wv = ^West Virginia
Dc > Md = DC,MDC
Al = AL,^Alabama
Ar = AR,^Arkansas
